# Art Gallery — a WebGPU photo mosaic: 10,000 photos in a 100x100 atlas, or a
# famous painting rebuilt from those photos (picked from a SwiftUI menu:
# movement > painter > painting, analysed and colour-matched on pick); pinch
# zooms around the focal point (rubber band at 0.5x), pans clamp to the
# canvas, past a threshold a pan snaps to the nearest photo cell (grid mode)
# and fast swipes step cell to cell; a zoom-out button appears past 1.5x.
# What this test covers: the default atlas, picking Mona Lisa and then a
# painting by another painter (reset + re-analysis + shuffle haptics),
# pinching in step by step to cell level, pans and swipes in every direction
# while zoomed, a pinch-out below 1.2x (snap back), the zoom-out button, going
# back to "Default" while zoomed, and taps that must not change anything.
# (Double-tap-to-zoom is not exercised: injected taps are too far apart for
# the 2-tap recogniser.) The menu button is the top-right "Choose a painting".
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/art-gallery"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "text" "Gallery" 30000
wait 2500
# Atlas: pinch in a bit and pan around, then pinch out (snap back).
gesture pinch 2 200 437
wait 1200
gesture pan 200 437 -150 0 400
wait 800
gesture pan 200 437 0 -150 400
wait 800
gesture pinch 0.5 200 437
wait 1500
# Pick Mona Lisa.
press "label=\"Choose a painting\""
wait 1200
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Renaissance\""
wait 1000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Leonardo da Vinci\""
wait 1000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Mona Lisa\""
wait 4000
# Zoom in step by step towards cell level.
gesture pinch 2.5 200 437
wait 1200
gesture pinch 2.5 200 437
wait 1200
gesture pinch 2.5 200 437
wait 1500
# Pans and fast swipes while zoomed (clamped, snapping in grid mode).
gesture pan 200 437 -150 0 600
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 437 150 0 600
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 437 0 -150 600
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 437 0 150 600
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 437 -120 0 100
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 437 0 -120 100
wait 1000
gesture pan 200 437 120 0 100
wait 1000
# Single taps do nothing.
press 200 437
wait 600
# Zoom-out button (bottom-right, unlabeled).
press 358 806
wait 1500
# Another painting from another movement, then zoom in and back to Default.
press "label=\"Choose a painting\""
wait 1200
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Impressionism\""
wait 1200
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Claude Monet\""
wait 1200
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Water Lilies\""
wait 4000
gesture pinch 2.5 200 437
wait 1200
gesture pan 200 437 -100 -100 500
wait 1000
# Back to Default while zoomed (springs back to 1x, atlas again).
press "label=\"Choose a painting\""
wait 1200
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Default\""
wait 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
